wrap break-words" dir=3D"ltr">This project investigates the spectro-tempora=
l characteristics of color Doppler twinkling in polymethyl methacrylate (PM=
MA) markers and compares them with non-twinkling metal targets.</p><p class=
=3D"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words" dir=3D"ltr">## Motivation</p><p class=
=3D"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words" dir=3D"ltr">Color Doppler twinkling ca=
n improve ultrasound visualization of highly reflective targets, but the si=
gnal characteristics responsible for the artifact remain unclear. This proj=
ect examines RF and IQ signals to identify temporal and frequency-domain fe=
atures associated with twinkling.</p><p class=3D"whitespace-pre-wrap break-=
words" dir=3D"ltr">## Methods</p><ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:p=
b-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-2.5 pl-7" dir=3D"ltr=
