em</li><li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">PMMA twinkling marker an=
d non-twinkling metal target</li><li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words=
">Plane-wave Doppler transmission</li><li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-=
words">4 MHz transmit frequency</li><li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-wo=
